   :PRIORITY 3 :BASIS
   ("Origin-relative image URLs (also with ports), validated dimensions and a responsive figure; any wiki benefits. The image RENDER-STORY-ITEM method is a method on upstream's generic function, so it is the one that needs the upstream file only because it replaces upstream's method of the same specializers.")
   :PLAN
   "Contribute. A method with identical specializers replaces upstream's in the same image, so it cannot move to another system without removing upstream's: it stays with the library until upstream has it."
